{"id":"allbuy-vpl-example-04-media-assets","revision":0,"last_node_id":18,"last_link_id":13,"nodes":[{"id":4,"type":"Note","pos":[960,100],"size":[360,310],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["04 · 素材加载（图/音/视频）\n\n1. 拖文件到节点、点「＋添加」选文件/文件夹，或悬停面板按 Ctrl+V（截图/复制的文件均可）。\n2. 图片 Tab：点选多张即生效（序号徽标 = batch 顺序，可拖拽排序）；⚙ 设缩放（最长边/最短边等）。\n3. 视频 Tab：单选一段，⚙ 设选区（起点/终点秒）、目标帧率（空=原速）、总帧上限——保存前实时显示输出帧数；帧序列从「视频帧」口输出，帧率数值从「帧率」口输出。\n4. 音频 Tab：单选一条，⚙ 拖波形选区定入出点，可试听；裁剪片段从「音频」口输出。\n5. 素材复制到 input/allbuy_media/ 持久化，随工作流保存。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"04 · 素材加载（图/音/视频）\n\n1. 拖文件到节点、点「＋添加」选文件/文件夹，或悬停面板按 Ctrl+V（截图/复制的文件均可）。\n2. 图片 Tab：点选多张即生效（序号徽标 = batch 顺序，可拖拽排序）；⚙ 设缩放（最长边/最短边等）。\n3. 视频 Tab：单选一段，⚙ 设选区（起点/终点秒）、目标帧率（空=原速）、总帧上限——保存前实时显示输出帧数；帧序列从「视频帧」口输出，帧率数值从「帧率」口输出。\n4. 音频 Tab：单选一条，⚙ 拖波形选区定入出点，可试听；裁剪片段从「音频」口输出。\n5. 素材复制到 input/allbuy_media/ 持久化，随工作流保存。"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":12,"type":"CreateVideo","pos":[580,470],"size":[270,140],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"图像组","localized_name":"图像","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":7},{"label":"音频","localized_name":"音频","name":"audio","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":8},{"localized_name":"帧率","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"fps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"位深度","name":"bit_depth","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"bit_depth"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"色彩空间","name":"color_space","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"color_space"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"视频","localized_name":"视频","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","links":[6]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"CreateVideo","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[24,8,"sRGB"],"widgets_values_named":{"fps":24,"bit_depth":8,"color_space":"sRGB"}},{"id":2,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[